      "subject": "כי כאיש גבורתו",
      "rationale": "'Bjalo ka motho, ka moo maatla a gagwe' — go bolela gore maatla a latela bohalaledi bja motho; ba bangwe ba bala 'gobane motho yoo o na le maatla a mabapi le go bolaya'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "זבח",
      "rationale": "Leina la kgoši ya Midiane le bolela 'sehlabelo' — Gideone o a 'hlabela' bjalo ka sehlabelo; se se lahlwa ka Sepedi."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "השהרנים",
      "rationale": "Pontšho tše ditlego tša sebopego sa kgwedi (maswini a dikgwedi), e sego dipontšho ka moka; 'crescents' kgahlanong le 'ornaments'."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme Zevakhe le Tsalemunake ba re: Tšoga, wena, o tle o re hlabetše, gobane bjalo ka motho, ka moo le maatla a gagwe; gomme Gideone a tšoga, a bolaya ⟨את⟩ Zevakhe le ⟨את⟩ Tsalemunake, gomme a tšea ⟨את⟩ dipontšho tša dikgwedi tšeo di lego ka mekgwarong ya dikameleng tša bona.",
